rguing against it: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, README.md, SECURITY.md and SKILL.md all go red -- four have no front matter the parser hard-fails without, CLAUDE.md is a single include directive, SKILL.md carries the Claude skill schema keys the parser rejects as unknown, the basis gate would then demand governing acts for each, and the examples gate would execute README's shell blocks, which are make test, make vet, make build and a network clone.","body":{"commit":"655bef02aeceaecea0f09078628d0bbbd71936de","path":"README.md"}}